  "description": "*“Shall we date for just six months?”*\n\nExhausted by her father’s constant pressure to met, Chae-Yun proposes a contract relationship to her childhood friend, Tae-San, while planning to go on an overseas study trip in six months. Tae-San gazed at Chae-Yun, whose eyes were sparkling, and gave a meaningful smile before saying, “But there are so many things I want to do with a lover... Do you think you can handle it?” “Of course! Just tell me anything.” “Alright. In exchange for being your lover for six months, I’ll do everything a lover can do.” It was the moment Chae-Yun became the limited-time lover of Tae-San, her male friend who was like family.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
